---
description: >-
  A small architecture-beta diagram (one VM in a nested group, a web app and
  database in a sibling subscription group) rendered with an explicit
  `seed: 42` override, verifying that setting a custom seed still produces a
  deterministic layout.
config:
  architecture:
    seed: 42
---
architecture-beta
  group sub1(cloud)[Subscription A]
  group vnet1(cloud)[VNet A] in sub1
  service vm1(server)[VM] in vnet1

  group sub2(cloud)[Subscription B]
  service web(server)[Web App] in sub2
  service db(database)[Registry] in sub2

  vm1:R --> L:web
  web:R --> L:db
